      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the hotlines. i've looked. but they dont change the fact that i'm broke, i'm losing my house, and i've ruined everything for my family. there's no \"getting through\" this. it's just a math problem and the numbers don't add up. there is no version of next month where this works.",
