    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the smallest thing? there isn't a small thing. everything is connected to the debt. even if i find a way to pay one bill, the interest just eats it. it's like a hole that only gets deeper. you said it sounds like an inescapable equation... if the math is truly impossible, what is even the point of staying in the loop?",
